/* 城镇与荒野日常瞬间 6处 × 4段 = 24段（集市/码头/学校/公园/森林/农场，1段1瞬间、必含双检定） */
:: MP Moment Market 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
高街早集的果蔬摊前，一辆手推车的木轮卡进石板缝，满筐黄澄澄的柑橘眼看就要顺着斜坡滚进泥水沟。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街集市 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-market-1">
<<tendingicon>><<link "上前顶住车辕稳住木筐 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-market-1">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	果农感激地擦了擦汗，挑出两颗最饱满的甜柑橘和几枚铜币塞进你手里。<span class="green">你帮果农保住了整车柑橘。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_market_1")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺集市往铜器摊走 (0:03)|MP Moment Market 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木筐边角磕在你的小腿上，几颗柑橘滚进水洼溅湿了你的裤脚。<span class="red">你被木筐磕痛了小腿。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[擦干手心汗水再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Market 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "眼疾手快垫入木楔卡住车轮 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-market-1">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_market_1_alt"] to 1>>
	你贴近集的果蔬摊前仔细辨认，顺势完成眼疾手快垫入。<span class="green">藏在坡滚进泥水沟里的玄机被你彻底摸清。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_market_1")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺集市往铜器摊走 (0:03)|MP Moment Market 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_market_1_alt"] to 1>>
	你盯着坡滚进泥水沟反复琢磨如何眼疾手快垫，一时没找准切入点。<span class="red">一辆手推车的传来轻微异响，你忙收敛动作退后半步。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[看准卡槽位置再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Market 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Market 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
集市转角的旧铜器摊上摆着十几只停摆的铜怀表，唯独角落一只缺了表链的银壳表还在滴答走字。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街集市 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-market-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "贴耳倾听擒纵轮咬合节拍 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-market-2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	你旋开底盖发现夹层里藏着一枚老书签与旧银币，摊主浑然不觉地低价让给了你。<span class="green">你淘到了暗藏夹层的银壳表。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_market_2")>><<money 300>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向街中段绸布摊 (0:03)|MP Moment Market 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	摊主见你盯得仔细，当即坐地起价，你只得放下怀表作罢。<span class="red">摊主抬高了价码，未能成交。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[放轻手腕力道再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Market 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "与摊主闲聊试探怀表来路 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-market-2">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_market_2_alt"] to 1>>
	你找准受力支点稳稳使力，手头动作一气呵成。<span class="green">事情办得干净利落，没有留下半点疏漏。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_market_2")>><<money 300>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向街中段绸布摊 (0:03)|MP Moment Market 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_market_2_alt"] to 1>>
	你发力时脚下微滑，手腕偏了半寸没能吃上劲。<span class="red">虎口隐隐发麻，只得先收手缓一口气。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[垫稳脚下重心再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Market 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Market 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
一阵穿堂横风猛地刮过集市中段，绸布摊顶棚的麻绳崩断，几匹染好的靛蓝丝绸眼看要被吹落到马车辙里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街集市 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-market-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "纵身跃起抓住翻飞的绸匹 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-market-3">>
<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	靛蓝丝绸毫发无损地卷回木轴，绣娘剪下一截精致丝带并包了手工钱谢你。<span class="green">你及时护住了名贵的靛蓝丝绸。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_market_3")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走到集市尾端烤饼炉 (0:03)|MP Moment Market 4]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	粗糙的棚架麻绳擦过你的掌心，火辣辣地疼。<span class="red">麻绳勒红了你的手掌。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[凑近微光看清再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Market 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "帮绣娘压住布架重新打结 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-market-3">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_market_3_alt"] to 1>>
	你顺着器物纹理巧施寸劲，原本卡滞的关窍应声松开。<span class="green">你将内里藏着的收获稳稳纳入怀中。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_market_3")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走到集市尾端烤饼炉 (0:03)|MP Moment Market 4]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_market_3_alt"] to 1>>
	冷不防一阵穿堂风吹来，迷了眼角也打乱了手头节奏。<span class="red">指尖在边缘滑脱，你只好先退开半步。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着纹理方向再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Market 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Market 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
黄昏散集时分，烤饼车的大肚铁炉还留着余温，老烘焙师正忙着把沉重的铁烤盘往板车上搬。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街集市 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-market-4">
<<tendingicon>><<link "搭把手抬起沉重的铸铁烤盘 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-market-4">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11500 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	老烘焙师笑着把最后两张刚出炉的芝麻热烤饼和跑腿小费塞进你怀里。<span class="green">热乎乎的烤饼香气扑鼻。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_market_4")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[顺夜色去商业巷口巡看 (0:04)|MP Night Event Alley 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	天色还早，你先回高街，打算入夜后再来。
	<<getouticon>><<link [[先回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<else>>
	烤盘余温未散，隔着粗布仍烫红了你的指尖。<span class="red">你被滚烫的铁盘边沿烫了一下。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[避开湿滑边角再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Market 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "帮烘焙师清点零钱归纸袋 (0:08)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-market-4">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 or ($english or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_market_4_alt"] to 1>>
	你麻利地将散乱的铜便士按十枚一摞码进钱匣，又把油纸袋叠得整整齐齐。<span class="green">老烘焙师乐呵呵地塞给你热烤饼与零钱。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_market_4")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街集市 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_market_4_alt"] to 1>>
黄昏风大吹跑了两只空纸袋，你追过去按住时手背擦过了木车边角。<span class="red">手背微微发红，钱匣还没来得及合上。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[活动酸麻手指再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Market 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Docks 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
三号栈桥边的涌浪越来越急，一艘驳船的系船粗麻缆在石桩上磨断了大半股，船头正往石阶上猛撞。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧港码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-docks-1">
<<tendingicon>><<link "甩出备用缆绳套住副铁桩 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-docks-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	驳船在离石阶半尺处稳稳停住，老水手抛给你几枚海港银币表示感谢。<span class="green">你及时系牢了险些脱锚的驳船。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_docks_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺栈道去鱼市冰槽 (0:03)|MP Moment Docks 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	浪花扑上栈桥打湿了你的裤腿，粗麻绳也擦破了你的虎口。<span class="red">海浪打湿衣裤，手掌被缆绳擦伤。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[按住底座晃动再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Docks 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "打水手双套结锁紧断缆 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-docks-1">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_docks_1_alt"] to 1>>
	<span class="green">你在细微处寻到了藏着的旧物与门道。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_docks_1")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺栈道去鱼市冰槽 (0:03)|MP Moment Docks 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_docks_1_alt"] to 1>>
	<span class="red">铜片边缘刮红了指腹，你只得先记下位置退开。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[拂去表面浮尘再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Docks 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Docks 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
码头鱼市卸货区的碎冰槽里，随着渔网倾倒出一只裹满绿海藻的锡封漂流瓶，瓶颈卡在排水铁箅子间。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧港码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-docks-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "趁搬运空档用铁钩挑出瓶子 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-docks-2">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	瓶内除了一张早年水手留下的航标字条，还塞着几枚防潮银币。<span class="green">你从碎冰槽里取出了锡封漂流瓶。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_docks_2")>><<money 260>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向起重机货场 (0:03)|MP Moment Docks 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	刺骨的盐水碎冰冻得你五指发麻，铁箅子还刮破了指节。<span class="red">冰水刺骨，手指被铁栅刮伤。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Docks 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "探入碎冰槽拔出软木塞 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-docks-2">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 430 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_docks_2_alt"] to 1>>
	你屏息听准周遭动静，趁着空档将手头之事妥善办完。<span class="green">整套手法行云流水，令人暗暗称奇。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_docks_2")>><<money 260>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向起重机货场 (0:03)|MP Moment Docks 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_docks_2_alt"] to 1>>
	内里的阻力比看上去沉得多，你试着扳动时震落了一层浮灰。<span class="red">为防弄出太大声响，你先行撤手暂退。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Docks 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|Docks]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Docks 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
港区二号蒸汽起重机的吊钩在半空摇晃，帆布货网的一角钩在了集装箱铁栓上，司炉工正急得探头张望。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回旧港码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-docks-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "攀上集装箱铁梯拨开挂网 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-docks-3">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	帆布货网顺利脱扣平稳落地，司炉工从驾驶室探出头丢给你一份搬运津贴。<span class="green">你帮起重机解开了卡死的货网。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_docks_3")>><<money 280>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[去引水栈桥看信号灯 (0:03)|MP Moment Docks 4]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
