<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	温暖的橘黄火苗重新照亮林间岔路，底座下露出了前人奉纳的几枚古币。<span class="green">指路石龛的灯火重新照亮迷雾。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_forest_4")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[入夜后往密林深处探看 (0:04)|MP Night Event Forest 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	天光还亮，你先退回林缘，打算入夜后再来。
	<<getouticon>><<link [[先回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<else>>
	潮湿的火柴连续划断了两根，冷风吹得你鼻尖发酸。<span class="red">火柴受潮难燃，冷风吹得你直缩脖颈。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[避开湿滑边角再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Forest 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "搬石板替石龛挡住穿堂风 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-forest-4">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11400>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_forest_4_alt"] to 1>>
	你借着旁侧遮挡掩去身形，指下轻巧地解开了最后一道束缚。<span class="green">轻巧地将卡在深处的东西收入囊中。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_forest_4")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回林间小径 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_forest_4_alt"] to 1>>
	顺势而为下，穿堂风吹得你指尖微僵，不觉工具在卡槽边滑了一下。<span class="red">重心微晃错失关窍。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[活动酸麻手指再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Forest 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|Forest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Farm 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>>
农场谷仓外侧的干草垛上，防雨油布被一阵狂风吹开了系绳，眼看阴云压顶就要淋湿整垛冬草。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农场田埂 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-farm-1">
<<tendingicon>><<link "爬木梯重新拉紧油布四角 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-farm-1">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	油布被捆得严严实实，路过的农场帮工塞给你几枚硬币和一只红苹果。<span class="green">你赶在落雨前护住了整垛干草。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_farm_1")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺田埂去灌溉木槽 (0:03)|MP Moment Farm 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	干草硬茬扎进了你的手腕袖口，刺痒难耐。<span class="red">干草碎茬扎得手腕皮肤发痒。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[按住底座晃动再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Farm 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[退回安全处 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "在草垛底部打双股防风绳结 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-farm-1">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_farm_1_alt"] to 1>>
	你细致比对前人留下的暗记，顺藤摸瓜找出了隐藏的门道。<span class="green">来龙去脉在你眼中已是一清二楚。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_farm_1")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[顺田埂去灌溉木槽 (0:03)|MP Moment Farm 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_farm_1_alt"] to 1>>
	你操之过急失了准头，衣袖还在粗糙的边沿挂了一下。<span class="red">你连忙拢好衣角，打算定下神再来。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[拂去表面浮尘再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Farm 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先回入口歇息 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Farm 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>>
麦田边的木制引水槽分水闸被一团水草与枯枝堵死，浑浊渠水正往田埂小路上漫溢。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农场田埂 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-farm-2">
<<tendingicon>><<link "用铁钩清走堵塞的枯枝 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-farm-2">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11400>>
	清澈渠水重新顺畅流入麦垄，你还在铁耙齿间勾起了一只遗落的铜钱袋。<span class="green">引水渠恢复通畅，麦垄得到了浇灌。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_farm_2")>><<money 260>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向牛棚木栏外侧 (0:03)|MP Moment Farm 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	渠底淤泥湿滑，泥浆溅满了你的小腿与鞋面。<span class="red">你在渠边滑了一脚，裤管沾满泥浆。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[听准机括声响再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Farm 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收起工具退回 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "提拉分水木闸调节两侧水位 (0:08)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-farm-2">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_farm_2_alt"] to 1>>
	你握住分水木闸的铁环向上提开两寸，借着激流冲力将堵在闸口的水草一举冲散。<span class="green">两侧水位恢复平衡，渠底露出一只小钱袋。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_farm_2")>><<money 260>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走向牛棚木栏外侧 (0:03)|MP Moment Farm 3]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_farm_2_alt"] to 1>>
木闸吸饱渠水后格外沉重，你提拉时水花溅湿了衣摆，闸板又滑了回去。<span class="red">虎口被铁环勒得发麻，只得先松手喘息。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[找准借力支点再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Farm 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身离开此地 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Farm 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>>
牛棚西侧的橡木围栏插销松脱了一半，一头黑白花奶牛正拿角顶着木门想要溜去菜园。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农场田埂 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-farm-3">
<<tendingicon>><<link "抓苜蓿草引回奶牛 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-farm-3">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	奶牛温顺地低头嚼起苜蓿草，木门重新落锁，挤奶女工笑着送给你一瓶鲜奶与工钱。<span class="green">你稳住奶牛锁好了牛棚围栏。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_farm_3")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走到打谷场旧风车下 (0:03)|MP Moment Farm 4]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木门被牛角顶得晃动，撞得你肩膀生疼。<span class="red">木门回撞震痛了你的肩膀。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收敛呼吸节奏再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Farm 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂退一步歇脚 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "顶住木门把铁插销敲回槽内 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-farm-3">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11500 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_farm_3_alt"] to 1>>
	<span class="green">你凭着耐心与巧思拿到了里层的收存。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_farm_3")>><<money 250>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[走到打谷场旧风车下 (0:03)|MP Moment Farm 4]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_farm_3_alt"] to 1>>
	<span class="red">你记下了卡扣的朝向，打算换个法子再来。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[挽起袖口稳稳再试 (0:04)|MP Moment Farm 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[顺原路退回 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Moment Farm 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>>
打谷场边的风车磨坊副帆索缠在了转向木轮上，风叶发出吱呀呀的干涩摩擦声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农场田埂 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<div id="moment-farm-4">
<<tendingicon>><<link "顺着转向架解缠绕的副帆索 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-farm-4">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	风车帆叶重新轻快转动起来，磨坊老汉从面粉袋旁摸出几枚银币塞给你。<span class="green">风车磨坊恢复了平稳运转。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_farm_4")>><<money 260>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[退潮夜去海礁浅湾探看 (0:04)|MP Night Event SeaRocks 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	天色还早，你先回海礁步道，打算入夜后再来。
	<<getouticon>><<link [[先回海礁步道 (0:02)|Sea Rocks]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<else>>
	粗糙的帆索磨红了你的指节，面粉灰也扑了一身。<span class="red">帆索擦伤指节，衣衫沾满面粉。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[换个角度再次尝试 (0:04)|MP Moment Farm 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂且收手离开 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "向木轮轴里抹上牛油膏 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#moment-farm-4">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_farm_4_alt"] to 1>>
	你放轻呼吸贴近细看，用巧劲化解了原本僵死的卡扣。<span class="green">妥善取出了藏在夹缝里的那份收获。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("moment_farm_4")>><<money 260>><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农场田埂 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpClues["mp_moment_farm_4_alt"] to 1>>
	稍一思忖，穿堂风吹得你指尖微僵，暗暗工具在卡槽边滑了一下。<span class="red">呼吸微乱难以寸进。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[稳住气息重新上手 (0:04)|MP Moment Farm 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回原处 (0:03)|Farmland]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
